# Per-mod opinion clamp (Rt56 scale). Shared opinion math divides by
# this macro; see _sandbox/.scratch/opinion-scale/issues/01-parameterize-opinion-divisor.md.
# Vanilla carries its own copy returning 100; this file is invisible to
# sync_core.py (mod-only, absent from core).
# Load order: macro libraries compile in sorted-path order and
# common/macros.hml calls this macro, so this file must sort before it
# ('_' sorts before 'm').
macro sandbox_opinion_scale():
  200
